{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kung Fu Addiction is an auto-battler combat game with rogue-like elements and meta-progression. Predict your opponent\u2019s next moves, earn attack, and defense points to unleash powerful special techniques. Master the art of anticipation in a thrilling single-player campaign or dominate multiplayer PvP matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/631e27c4e385411a1e59eb539aa8f302.poster.avif?t=1760642528\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/631e27c4e385411a1e59eb539aa8f302.webm?t=1760642528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/631e27c4e385411a1e59eb539aa8f302.mp4?t=1760642528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MIND GAME DISGUISED AS MARTIAL ARTS COMBAT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In most game modes, you will face randomized fight sequences, where you must decide where to attack and where to defend. Outsmart your opponent by landing successful hits and blocking their moves. Trust your instincts to make the right choices. Every successful action grants you attack and defense points that you can use to cast special techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/883e69a8e65eefc73ecd61cdf598bb20.poster.avif?t=1760642528\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/883e69a8e65eefc73ecd61cdf598bb20.webm?t=1760642528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/883e69a8e65eefc73ecd61cdf598bb20.mp4?t=1760642528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE ONE OR MULTIPLE THREATS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your  rewards strategically to fight the next enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/3956284a2c06cd2c5542703a8f4b4cf8.poster.avif?t=1760642528\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/3956284a2c06cd2c5542703a8f4b4cf8.webm?t=1760642528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/3956284a2c06cd2c5542703a8f4b4cf8.mp4?t=1760642528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620860?t=1760642528","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/1ce97779c06af41d2d1bb26c5701401fd2272bec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760642528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/70dcce5acdb44762b6b9a5dc06e1462fea92cc15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760642528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/70dcce5acdb44762b6b9a5dc06e1462fea92cc15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760642528","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_pa